
# Cupcake Emulator

An Android 1.5 Cupcake emulator for Android devices and desktop computers.

## About

Cupcake Emulator is an open-source project designed to reproduce
the original Android 1.5 Cupcake operating system.

The project aims to support:

- Android smartphones and tablets
- Windows computers
- Linux computers
- macOS computers
- Original Android 1.5 interface
- APK installation
- Legacy Android application compatibility
- ARM emulation
- Virtual storage
- Touchscreen, keyboard and mouse input
- Audio support

## Original operating system

- Name: Android Cupcake
- Version: 1.5
- API Level: 3
- Release year: 2009

## Project architecture

The project is divided into:

- android: Android application
- desktop: Desktop application
- emulator: Emulation engine
- cupcake: Android 1.5 system
- compatibility: Legacy APK compatibility
- docs: Project documentation

## Development status

This project is under development.

No complete Android 1.5 emulation or universal APK
compatibility is claimed yet.

## Platforms

| Platform | Planned support |
|---|---|
| Android | Yes |
| Windows | Yes |
| Linux | Yes |
| macOS | Yes |

## Important

The original Android operating system must run inside
the emulator. The host application is not a replacement
for the phone's installed Android operating system.

